  "short_description": "《Dumb Ways to Build》是一款混亂、大玩物理效果的合作建造遊戲。快和朋友組隊集結你的工班，一起接下危險的建築工程。裝備很齊全，腦袋卻空空，大家一起齊心協力蓋出前進的道路，不然就等著出包送命！",
  "short_description_en": "Dumb Ways to Build is a chaotic, physics-based co-op game. Team up with friends to assemble your crew and take-on dangerous construction jobs. With all the gear and no idea, work together to build your path forward, or die trying!",
